..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. Name           : CREDITNOTE.BSTART.BA
.. Author         : mh
.. Verantwortlich : mh
.. Kontrolle      : 
.. Functionality  : Fill table with data for credit note.
..*****************************************************************************
.. 1) Report header efop ('M|bkopf')
..    + read information of edi message "header" fields
..    + read information from "original message" (should be replaced with mapping!)
.. 2) Report row efop ('M|tab')
..    + for each "item" find matching delivery and/or invoice items in abas erp
..    + check if item in erp can be released
.. 3) Report footer efop ('M|bfuss')
..*****************************************************************************
..!meta M|=dfue/CREDITNOTE
.set trans -
..
.. Fill table with credit note items from edi message
.input 'M|bkopf' 
..
.. Find matching information for each credit note item in abas erp
.select screen header
!NEXTROW 
.select screen line
.continue ENDROWS ? _G|mehr
.input 'M|tab'
.continue NEXTROW
!ENDROWS
..
.. (not used yet)
.input 'M|bfuss'
.. 
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
